    246  7273							; ---------------------------------------------------------
    247  7273							; p1_bands: what player 1 shows. Band A (above the
    248  7273							; seam, or the whole room): the thing of the room and the
    249  7273							; guard of the band (the second guard with a seam, else
    250  7273							; the first), each when it is there (the gate goes once
    251  7273							; open, a guard once killed); both in turn: the thing in
    252  7273							; even frames, the guard in odd ones (the flicker; they
    253  7273							; share lines); neither: the empty figure. Band B: the
    254  7273							; first guard, or the empty figure when it is dead (its
    255  7273							; column, in the coarse delay and the fine move of the
    256  7273							; seam, comes from things.asm, after it crawls).
    257  7273							; The pointers: base of the figure (two frames, every 16
    258  7273							; frames) + top line.
